w information submitted through this website is handled.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container legal"><p class="eyebrow purple">LEGAL</p><h2>Privacy Policy</h2><p>This website is a prototype presentation for L&amp;E Imports. If you contact L&amp;E Imports by WhatsApp, email or the enquiry form, the information you provide may be used to respond to your request.</p><h3>Information submitted</h3><p>The contact form may collect your name, business name, telephone number, email address and message. This information is used only to handle your enquiry and communicate with you about it.</p><h3>External services</h3><p>WhatsApp, email, Google Maps and Facebook are external services with their own privacy policies. Please review those policies when using their links.</p><h3>Contact</h3><p>For questions about this website or an enquiry, contact L&amp;E Imports at <a href="mailto:info@leimports.com">info@leimports.com</a>.</p></div></section><footer class="footer"><div class="container footer-grid"><div><a class="brand footer-brand" href="index.html"><span class="brand-mark">L&amp;E</span><span class="brand-name">IMPORTS</span></a><p>Imported food products and dependable distribution for Malta’s retail and foodservice businesses.</p></div><div><h3>Explore</h3><a href="index.html">Home</a><a href="about.html">About Us</a><a href="brands.html">Our Brands</a><a href="distribution.html">Distribution &amp; Services</a><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></div><div><h3>Contact</h3><a href="tel:+35699474578">9947 4578</a><a href="mailto:info@leimports.com">info@leimports.com</a><span>46 Vjal il-Ħelsien<br>Ħaż-Żebbuġ, Malta<br>ZBG 2493</span><a href="https://www.facebook.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook ↗</a></div><div><h3>Start a conversation</h3><p>Tell us what your business needs and our team will get back to you directly.</p><a class="btn light" href="https://wa.me/35699474578?text=Hello%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20request%20a%20quote%20fro